{
  "$schema": "https://mintlify.com/docs.json",
  "theme": "mint",
  "name": "LarkX",
  "description": "Durable execution for on-device AI agents. The public reference for the React Native SDK.",
  "colors": {
    "primary": "#4d7a2e",
    "light": "#c7fa75",
    "dark": "#c7fa75"
  },
  "appearance": {
    "default": "dark"
  },
  "background": {
    "color": {
      "dark": "#0b0d10"
    }
  },
  "styling": {
    "codeblocks": "dark"
  },
  "fonts": {
    "family": "Inter"
  },
  "icons": {
    "library": "lucide"
  },
  "logo": {
    "light": "/logo/light.svg",
    "dark": "/logo/dark.svg",
    "href": "https://www.larkx.ai"
  },
  "favicon": "/favicon.svg",
  "navbar": {
    "links": [
      {
        "label": "Website",
        "href": "https://www.larkx.ai"
      },
      {
        "label": "Cloud",
        "href": "https://cloud.larkx.ai"
      }
    ],
    "primary": {
      "type": "github",
      "href": "https://github.com/larkxai/larkx"
    }
  },
  "footer": {
    "socials": {
      "website": "https://www.larkx.ai",
      "github": "https://github.com/larkxai/larkx"
    },
    "links": [
      {
        "header": "LarkX",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Website",
            "href": "https://www.larkx.ai"
          },
          {
            "label": "Cloud",
            "href": "https://cloud.larkx.ai"
          },
          {
            "label": "GitHub",
            "href": "https://github.com/larkxai/larkx"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "header": "SDK",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "npm",
            "href": "https://www.npmjs.com/package/@larkxai/react-native"
          },
          {
            "label": "Examples",
            "href": "https://github.com/larkxai/larkx/tree/main/examples"
          },
          {
            "label": "Roadmap",
            "href": "https://github.com/larkxai/larkx/blob/main/ROADMAP.md"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "contextual": {
    "display": "header",
    "options": ["copy", "view", "cursor", "mcp", "assistant"]
  },
  "markdown": {
    "schema": true,
    "instructions": [
      "LarkX is open-source execution infrastructure for on-device AI agents. It is not an inference engine, an LLM wrapper, a cloud-only agent framework, or a replacement for LangGraph or Cactus.",
      "Install the public SDK with npm install @larkxai/react-native. The published version is the sdkVersion variable on the Installation page. Import createRuntime, defineTool, scriptedModel, sqlite, remoteAgent, and larkxCloud from @larkxai/react-native. Import cactusModel from @larkxai/react-native/cactus only when the app uses local inference.",
      "Do not import @larkxai/node, @larkxai/host, @larkxai/protocol, @larkxai/telemetry, or @larkxai/cactus. Those packages are private. Swift and Kotlin SDKs are not published.",
      "Hello World uses scriptedModel and does not download a model or need Cloud. A Cactus agent needs cactus-react-native 1.13.1, react-native-nitro-modules 0.33.9 or newer, download(), and init() before start. Expo Go cannot load the native module.",
      "Recovery opens a new createRuntime on the same SQLite file, registers the same agent name and version, then calls resume. Do not call resume on a runtime that has already been closed. Do not describe external effects as exactly-once. A killed process does not keep running.",
      "Cloud telemetry is optional. Pass larkxCloud({ projectId, apiKey }) only after a local run already works. The key must start with lkx_ing_."
    ]
  },
  "seo": {
    "indexing": "navigable",
    "organization": {
      "name": "LarkX",
      "url": "https://www.larkx.ai",
      "sameAs": ["https://github.com/larkxai/larkx", "https://cloud.larkx.ai"]
    }
  },
  "search": {
    "prompt": "Search LarkX"
  },
  "variables": {
    "sdkVersion": "0.4.1"
  },
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/getting-started/quickstart",
      "destination": "/getting-started/hello-world"
    },
    {
      "source": "/resources/examples",
      "destination": "/examples/field-inspection"
    }
  ],
  "navigation": {
    "groups": [
